{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/448ef3522e3340813d2fc3a223ab7ffc.avif?t=1773756186\" width=1024 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell Bug is a fast-paced action roguelike game, with lots of fun and unique guns AND abilities, fight with insects as insects. Choose your character, AFTER defeating the bosses for the first time, you will unlock new characters that has the bosses' abilities in a smaller scale but the fun stays the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/9fc2e5ebb46a40c1d12a16883d47e73b.poster.avif?t=1773756186\" width=1120 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/9fc2e5ebb46a40c1d12a16883d47e73b.webm?t=1773756186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/9fc2e5ebb46a40c1d12a16883d47e73b.mp4?t=1773756186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some normal bugs tried to survive in their nests, one of them was our brave ant soldier,he did everything he could to keep  his family and nest alive. But he needs equal power to fight with the evil Hell Bugs, so collect eggs from the bosses that you defeat and raise your little Hell Bug army and fight with characters that each have unique abilities!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/eee5f5086abef2556f43d75dd2b096ce.poster.avif?t=1773756186\" width=1120 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/eee5f5086abef2556f43d75dd2b096ce.webm?t=1773756186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/eee5f5086abef2556f43d75dd2b096ce.mp4?t=1773756186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>With precedural systems like rooms that were hand-crafted and embedded in random system, also with lots of different   weaponry, you can expect to encounter ANYTHING, therefore the fun never ends! You don't die permanently in this universe because of your mutational powers, so don't be sad when you &quot;die&quot;, grab your gun and start again to explore the world of bugs from Hell Bug's perspective!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400470?t=1773756186","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400470?t=1773756186","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/60cd858251d6eba19b7d20558ab611f7e5fa837f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773756186","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/60cd858251d6eba19b7d20558ab611f7e5fa837f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773756186","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4015550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/448ef3522e3340813d2fc3a223ab7ffc.avif?t=1773756186\" width=1024 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell Bug is a fast-paced action roguelike game, with lots of fun and unique guns AND abilities, fight with insects as insects. Choose your character, AFTER defeating the bosses for the first time, you will unlock new characters that has the bosses' abilities in a smaller scale but the fun stays the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/9fc2e5ebb46a40c1d12a16883d47e73b.poster.avif?t=1773756186\" width=1120 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/9fc2e5ebb46a40c1d12a16883d47e73b.webm?t=1773756186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/9fc2e5ebb46a40c1d12a16883d47e73b.mp4?t=1773756186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some normal bugs tried to survive in their nests, one of them was our brave ant soldier,he did everything he could to keep  his family and nest alive. But he needs equal power to fight with the evil Hell Bugs, so collect eggs from the bosses that you defeat and raise your little Hell Bug army and fight with characters that each have unique abilities!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/eee5f5086abef2556f43d75dd2b096ce.poster.avif?t=1773756186\" width=1120 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/eee5f5086abef2556f43d75dd2b096ce.webm?t=1773756186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/extras/eee5f5086abef2556f43d75dd2b096ce.mp4?t=1773756186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>With precedural systems like rooms that were hand-crafted and embedded in random system, also with lots of different   weaponry, you can expect to encounter ANYTHING, therefore the fun never ends! You don't die permanently in this universe because of your mutational powers, so don't be sad when you &quot;die&quot;, grab your gun and start again to explore the world of bugs from Hell Bug's perspective!</p>","developers":["Artisan Knights Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400470/a44240516d2e15ada11bdd8ab75886a37975ab84/header.jpg?t=1773756186","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3400470/264004551/9db910f09fe3f4c4b7582499068342a7f57613e9/1770842322/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770842858","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3400470/264004551/9db910f09fe3f4c4b7582499068342a7f57613e9/1770842322/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770842858","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3400470/264004551/9db910f09fe3f4c4b7582499068342a7f57613e9/1770842322/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770842858","id":257201138,"name":"Hell Bug Full Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257201138/aa8d1ca7ee5dd2bd13b9a0a491fa1ccc7b5c1b2e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770842858"}],"name":"Hell Bug","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-5200U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any screen that can play a video<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Artisan Knights Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned